Subject: [PATCH] =?UTF-8?q?Agregar=20enfoque=20psicoeducativo=20a=20genera?=
 =?UTF-8?q?ci=C3=B3n=20de=20temas=20(contenido=20para=20terapia/consulta?=
 =?UTF-8?q?=20en=20vez=20de=20material=20escolar)?=
